{"v":2,"catch":"在如此嚴峻的情況下，您能扭轉局勢嗎？","desc":"《SUPER BASKETBALL》是 KONAMI 於 1984 年發行的運動遊戲。\n遊戲中共有 10 支球隊參賽。每場比賽都以劣勢開局。\n運用熟練的盤帶和傳球技巧扭轉局勢，力爭在規定時間內取得勝利。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-07-17","genres":["運動","動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/82f65a869f4591702c73cbf87e986bb7a03a900ef4996809a74a45d1b6f456b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/db14c17d3e5adf2ee2b227f6c48692b5ada1f279890368ebe707a1e70deb7370.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bf20d993ab862934cb304550562d58c8736f1a5d194edb08941408372c07d6a2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/da1ccd1cb564ef2d4c2305a516c8bff0c8dec0157f9afa8a1df19c7beac5a68e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77d4f30666098c4da5a5c0b312a08447f815126e04ed4e99c9e79b55a08f7107.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/24e46de2b706f5c151b8a25997cddc2689bf936e86259ec16653dbf7493e8078.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e9b02394c000"}